# T6.6 Sub-ETL-1 — restaurant chain raw + canonical CSV (gitignore policy per PR #330)
# Q-DEC verbal sign-off 2026-05-12: 餐饮客户数据不提交仓 (raw Excel + canonical CSV
# generated by scripts/etl/normalize_restaurant_chains.py both stay local).
# Glob children — directory parents stay tracked so .gitkeep placeholders preserve
# the directory tree (git negation can't re-include a file under an excluded dir).
data/imports/restaurant-chains/**
data/imports/_quarantine/**
data/imports/_index.json
!data/imports/restaurant-chains/.gitkeep
!data/imports/_quarantine/.gitkeep

